OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites.
OL,9,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     FThe BBC Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,11,     Fwith chief conductor John
OL,12,     FStorgards at the Bridgewater Hall
OL,13,     Fin Manchester with music by
OL,14,     FCassandra Miller, Mendelssohn and
OL,15,     FMahler.
OL,16,G2145 The Essay: Symphony of the Wild
OL,17,     FMusic is thought to be unique to
OL,18,     Fhumans. But does it echo deeper
OL,19,     Finto nature? Ben Garrod discovers
OL,20,     Fsome remarkable rhythms coming
OL,21,     Ffrom some of earth's oldest
OL,22,     Fmusicians: plants.
